{% doc %}
  @prompt
    1. Hero Section Prompt
    
    Create a Black Friday hero banner for a luxury jewelry website.
    Use a black background with subtle gold sparkles or particle animation.
    Text:
    
    Large heading: “BLACK FRIDAY SALE”
    
    Subtext: “Flat 40% OFF on Best Selling Items & 30% OFF on Old Cut Collection.”
    Add two gold buttons side by side:
    
    Button 1: “Shop Best Sellers” → link /collections/best-selling
    
    Button 2: “Shop Old Cuts” → link /collections/old-cut
    Center align everything vertically and horizontally.
    Font color: white and gold (#d4af37).
    Make it mobile responsive and elegant.
    
    🧭 2. Scrolling Marquee Prompt
    
    Create a horizontal scrolling marquee bar with black background and gold text.
    The text should continuously scroll and repeat like this:
    “Black Friday Sale 🔥 | Old Cut Collection Sale 💎 | Customize Stud Offer ✨ | Ready To Ship Deals 🛍”
    Font color: gold (#d4af37), font size: 16px.
    Add a subtle glowing animation on hover.
    
    💎 3. Best Selling Items Section Prompt
    
    Create a Best Selling Items section for a jewelry store.
    Title: “Best Selling Items”
    Below it, display a 4-column grid (responsive) with product cards.
    Each card includes:
    
    Product image (sample placeholder)
    
    Product title
    
    A subtle box shadow and hover zoom-in effect
    
    Button: “View All” (gold button at center below grid).
    Background: pure black, text white, accent color gold (#d4af37).
    Add soft padding around section (60px top and bottom).
    
    💍 4. Product Offer Grid Prompt
    
    Create a 2x2 product offer grid like a promotional showcase.
    Each block shows:
    
    Jewelry image on dark black background
    
    A red corner badge like “Flat 40% OFF”
    
    Category name in gold text (Customize Stud, Solitaire Ring, Old Cut Collection, Ready To Ship)
    
    “Shop Now” button in gold with hover black background.
    Layout: 2x2 grid on desktop, 1x1 on mobile.
    Maintain high-end luxury feel (black + gold + minimal shadows).
    
    ⭐ 5. Customer Reviews Carousel Prompt
    
    Create a customer reviews carousel in luxury style.
    Each card includes:
    
    Customer photo
    
    Name
    
